    "innovation": "This editorial introduces a special issue presenting new advances from the Tropical Atlantic Climate Experiment (TACE) in observing, modeling, understanding, and predicting Tropical Atlantic Variability and its associated biases in coupled climate models.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
        {
            "source_entity_instance": "Atlantic cold tongue",
